---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import signature from '@assets/images/signature.webp';
---

<div class="container-custom">
  <section class="lg:px-8; mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6" data-theme="dark">
    <header class="mb-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-clash-display-bold text-5xl text-slate-900">
        <span class="block">Struggling with conversions?</span>
        <span class="block">It shouldn't be this hard</span>
      </h2>
    </header>
    <article class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-start">
      <div class="grid flex-1 content-start">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl">
          Every business collects data. Mountains of it. And conversion rates? Still embarrassingly
          low.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-12 text-xl md:text-2xl">
          When sales dip, everyone reaches for the same playbook: throw money at ads. More traffic
          will fix it, right? Wrong.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-12 text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">
          Your visitor behavior already holds the answer. Fix your conversion rate once, and it pays
          off for years.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid flex-1 content-start">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl">
          The catch? Conversion optimization is hard. Most tools are complicated, expensive, or
          both.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-12 text-xl md:text-2xl">
          Not Air360. We make it dead simple to understand what's actually happening on your site.
          No PhD required. No dashboard hell. Just answers.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-12 text-xl md:text-2xl">
          Poke around. Watch the videos. Get in touch. We'd be honored to have you as a customer.
          Thank you.
        </p>

        <Image src={signature} alt="Signature of Air360 CEO" class="mt-8 h-16 w-auto p-2" />
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</div>
